=== no same-window reserved scene; Round 3 reserves 12 Dec and 16 Jan ===
  Those two are scored in `validate.report`, not here. They sit outside the
  kharif window on purpose, which is what makes them independent and also
  what limits what they can test.
  The 13 Oct correlation below is then a DIAGNOSTIC, not a held-out test:
  that scene set BIOMASS_SIGN and the tier-2 ranking axis. Stated outcome.

