total 893.9 t (Round 3 labels) vs 880.3 t (Round 2 labels): +1.5 %
The village total is far less sensitive to the labelling than the per-crop split is,
which is the expected shape: relabelling moves area between cohorts whose reference yields
are 1.4-2.7 t/ha, so it redistributes production without creating or destroying much of it.

